行免許はまだ持ってないよね？","nextNodeIds":[4810106]},{"nodeId":4810106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":559589371,"text":"飛行免許？なんだそれ？","nextNodeIds":[4810107]},{"nodeId":4810107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2490250371,"text":"名前のまんまなんだけど、その飛行免許を持っている人だけが、このモンド城内を飛行できるんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[4810108]},{"nodeId":4810108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":431973363,"text":"#えっ…{NICKNAME}、もう結構飛んでるぞ…そんな話、全然聞いたことない…","nextNodeIds":[4810109]},{"nodeId":4810109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3246926699,"text":"毎日あちこち飛んでたから、みんなの目に留まったみたいだね！","nextNodeIds":[4810110]},{"nodeId":4810110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4247783395,"text":"えへっ。","nextNodeIds":[4810111]},{"nodeId":4810111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1015928595,"text":"じゃあ、今日は飛行免許を届けにきてくれたのか？","nextNodeIds":[4810112]},{"nodeId":4810112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1400109347,"text":"まさか！騎士にだってちゃんと規則があるからね。","nextNodeIds":[4810113]},{"nodeId":4810113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2074277067,"text":"飛行免許はテストに合格してから騎士団が発行するの。","nextNodeIds":[4810114]},{"nodeId":4810114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":302286843,"text":"今日は試験官として、あんたの飛行免許のテストを監督しに来たんだ！","nextNodeIds":[4810115]},{"nodeId":4810115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3411189099,"text":"風の翼を渡したのはわたしだからね、責任を持たないと——きっと、ジンさんもそう言うし。","nextNodeIds":[4810116]},{"nodeId":4810117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":805693955,"text":"ちょっとくらいズルしても…","nextNodeIds":[4810118]},{"nodeId":4810119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2130999835,"text":"自力で合格する。","nextNodeIds":[4810120]},{"nodeId":4810116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2320592755,"text":"テスト…なんか面倒だな。でも、アンバーが試験官なら…","nextNodeIds":[4810117,4810119]},{"nodeId":4810118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":689761243,"text":"そんな目で見ないで、絶対にダーーメだからね。","nextNodeIds":[4810121]},{"nodeId":4810120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1937051123,"text":"#うん、{NICKNAME}なら楽勝だよ。","nextNodeIds":[4810121]},{"nodeId":4810121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3414461267,"text":"それに簡単な試験だから安心して。風魔龍を撃退した時の飛行ができれば問題ないはずだよ。","nextNodeIds":[4810122]},{"nodeId":4810122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":949480091,"text":"でも、規則と飛行基準は守らないとダメだからね。","nextNodeIds":[4810123]},{"nodeId":4810123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3907304907,"text":"この『飛行指南』をあげる。覚えなくてもいいけど、理解はしておいてね。","nextNodeIds":[4810124]},{"nodeId":4810124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":242870179,"text":"たとえば、二人で風の翼を使うのは禁止とか、重い荷物を持って飛ぶのは禁止とか、風スライムを使った飛行は禁止とか…","nextNodeIds":[4810125]},{"nodeId":4810125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":4275023419,"text":"とにかく、よく読んでおいて。リサさんに魔法を教えてもらった時だって、わたしも厚い本をたくさん読んだんだから…","nextNodeIds":[4810126]},{"nodeId":4810126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":595253539,"text":"ぶ厚いな…仕方ない、とりあえず読んでみるか。","nextNodeIds":[4810127]},{"nodeId":4810127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":859243331,"text":"うん！読み終えたら風立ちの地に来て。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":4810401,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2377423531,"text":"西風騎士団の『飛行指南』、タイトルからして難しそうだ…","nextNodeIds":[4810402]},{"nodeId":4810402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3871310491,"text":"とりあえず読んでみよう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":4810602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":151875731,"text":"寓話みたいだ。","nextNodeIds":[4810604]},{"nodeId":4810603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3106494707,"text":"ロマンチックだね…","nextNodeIds":[4810604]},{"nodeId":4810601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3151902955,"text":"いい話だったな…けど、騎士団の『飛行指南』って…こんな感じなのか？","nextNodeIds":[4810602,4810603]},{"nodeId":4810604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":782974307,"text":"とにかく、アンバーのところに行こう。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[48101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1002"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":48102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":3390120327,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_GAME_TIME_TICK","PPFLKMOMKAI":"0,24"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_